OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 8 JAN
OL,4,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,5,     GIsata Kanneh-Mason conquers the
OL,6,     Glegendary "Everest of piano
OL,7,     Gconcertos" and Delyana Lazarova
OL,8,     Gmakes her debut as Principal
OL,9,     GGuest Conductor with the BBC
OL,10,     GScottish Symphony Orchestra.
OL,11,G2145FThe Essay: Instrumental
OL,12,     GAlan Hall talks with the
OL,13,     Gprofessional piano accordionist
OL,14,     GKaren Tweed, who has been under
OL,15,     Gthe spell of her instrument since
OL,16,     Gthe age of 11.
OL,17,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,18,     GHannah Peel presents an
OL,19,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,20,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,21,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,22,     Geverything in between.
